Daily Study Method 
For each study session, use this approach: 
15 Minutes — Learn 
Watch a lesson, read documentation, or study examples. 
15 Minutes — Follow Along 
Write the examples yourself rather than simply watching. 
30 Minutes — Practice 
Solve SQL problems without looking at the answer. 
Final 5 Minutes — Review 
Write down: 
• What I learned 
• What I struggled with 
• What I need to practice next 
Final Goal 
After four weeks and approximately 10 hours of focused practice, the goal is not to become 
an SQL expert. 
